  "details": "So, I've encountered a bug that happens when I'm in an instance with 11+ people in it; the more people, the more likely it is to to happen. What the bug causes is:\n\n1. Mutes all game audio output, despite audio settings tab showing nothing has changed; this includes background music/sound effects and avatar sounds.\n\n2. Mutes ME and prevents me from speaking outside of text, and the game doesn't indicate that I'm muted as a result unless I already was prior to the bug.\n\n3. Freezes my face and hands.\n\nI have no Idea why this is occurring, but it has happened multiple times within several hours, so long as I'm in an instance with 11+ people. My headset is a 64gb Quest 2 and main system sounds work like normal regardless, if that helps any.\n\nIf you are a dev or apart of VRC staff and would like to ask me some more questions, or maybe witness it live, please contact me on Discord; I'm in the official server with the same name as my VRC user.",
